  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCB ZamStats Increased availability of relevant statistics, 2025-2028 - SCB Zamstats 2025-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SCB ZamStats, &#xd6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng till relevant statistik, 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development objective

Official statistics is used to design policies for better living conditions in Zambia. 

Project overall outcome

Enhanced capacity to produce statistics in line with user needs, sound statistical methods and international standards.

Component outcomes

Component 1: Management

Component objective/outcome: ZamStats has a leadership team that motivates and supports the staff to successfully adopt change in order to achieve the organisation&apos;s goals.  

Component 2: Coordination 

Component objective/outcome: A strengthened National Statistical System (NSS) that fosters stronger interagency collaborations to improve data integration, sharing, and dissemination across key government entities.

Component 3: Statistical Methodology 

Component objective/outcome: Enhanced methodological capacity 

Component 4: Economic Statistics 

Component objective/outcome: Enhanced capacity for ZamStats to produce timely and relevant economic statistics.

Component 5: Agriculture, Environment and Social Statistics 

Component objective/outcome 1: Agricultural and Environment statistics contributes to evidenced based decision-making on food security in the country. 

Component objective/outcome 2: Household Budget Survey is produced to inform the users on critical socio-economic, agricultural and environment indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ZamStats f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka ledarskapet av ZamStats, samordningen av det nationella statistiksystemet samt metodologisk kapacitet inom ekonomi-, jordbruks-, milj&#xf6;- och socialstatistik. Kapacitetsuppbyggnaden genomf&#xf6;rs av Statistics Sweden. St&#xf6;d ges &#xe4;ven till genomf&#xf6;randet av en &#xe5;rlig hush&#xe5;llsbudgetunders&#xf6;kning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to ZamStats to strengthen the management of ZamStats, the coordination of the National Statistical System, methodological capacity in economic, agriculture, environment and social statistics. The capacity building is implemented by Statistics Sweden. Support is also giver to conduct a yearly Household Budget Survey.</narrative>
  </description>
